sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kafka
    participant Q as Kafka engine
    participant F as order_facts
    participant R as revenue_per_minute
    K->>Q: OrderConfirmed e1 (100.00)
    Q->>F: fact e1
    K->>Q: OrderConfirmed e1 again (relay retry)
    Q->>F: fact e1 (second row, same key)
    Note over F: FINAL reads one row now, a merge removes the other later
    R->>F: every 30 s: SELECT … FROM order_facts FINAL
    Note over R: revenue 100.00, orders 1
